{"status":200,"data":[{"uuid":"e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f","displayName":"盖可","description":"西海岸小伙“盖可”随身带着一群调皮捣蛋的小怪兽。这些小跟班们负责冲在战斗的最前方，给敌人制造各种麻烦。等到盖可追上来后，它们还能回到他身边，然后再次出击。","developerName":"Aggrobot","releaseDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","characterTags":null,"displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/displayicon.png","displayIconSmall":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/displayicon.png","bustPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/fullportrait.png","fullPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/fullportrait.png","fullPortraitV2":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/fullportrait.png","killfeedPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/killfeedportrait.png","minimapPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/minimapportrait.png","homeScreenPromoTileImage":null,"background":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/background.png","backgroundGradientColors":["371c5cff","0f1923ff","3a2656ff","0f192300"],"assetPath":"ShooterGame/Content/Characters/AggroBot/AggroBot_PrimaryAsset","isFullPortraitRightFacing":false,"isPlayableCharacter":true,"isAvailableForTest":false,"isBaseContent":false,"role":{"uuid":"1b47567f-8f7b-444b-aae3-b0c634622d10","displayName":"先锋","description":"先锋能够为队伍打开局面，帮助队友进入交战区域并驱逐敌方防守力量。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/roles/1b47567f-8f7b-444b-aae3-b0c634622d10/displayicon.png","assetPath":"ShooterGame/Content/Characters/_Core/Roles/Breaker_PrimaryDataAsset"},"recruitmentData":null,"abilities":[{"slot":"Ability1","displayName":"顽皮搭档","description":"装备宠物“皮蛋”。按【射击】派皮蛋去前方搜寻敌人。发现首名敌人后，皮蛋将对其发射震荡冲击。瞄准爆能器部署区域或已部署的爆能器后，按下【辅助射击】可以派皮蛋前去部署或拆除爆能器。盖可的物品栏中必须拥有爆能器才能进行部署。技能失效后，皮蛋将变回一颗休眠的球体。与球体【互动】即可将其回收，在短暂的冷却时间后可再次获得顽皮搭档充能。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/abilities/ability1/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Ability2","displayName":"炫晕光波","description":"装备宠物“丢丢”。按【射击】派它飞向天空。丢丢会对视线范围内的敌人使用电浆冲击。被电浆命中的敌人将被【致盲】。技能失效后，丢丢将变回一颗休眠的球体。与球体【互动】即可将其回收，在短暂的冷却时间后可再次获得炫晕光波充能。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/abilities/ability2/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Grenade","displayName":"嗨爆全场","description":"装备宠物“嗨宝”。按【射击】即可将其掷出。按【辅助射击】可轻抛。落地后，嗨宝会在一大片区域内复制自己，持续造成少量伤害，并在短暂延迟后爆炸。与球体【互动】即可将其回收，在短暂的冷却时间后可再次获得嗨爆全场充能。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/abilities/grenade/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Ultimate","displayName":"无敌超鲨","description":"装备宠物“鲨鲨”。按【射击】与鲨鲨的意识进行相连，控制她穿越敌人领地。按【激活】即可让鲨鲨向前冲刺并爆炸，【束缚】小范围内的所有玩家。技能失效后，鲨鲨将变回一颗休眠的球体。与球体【互动】即可将其回收，在短暂的冷却时间后可再次获得无敌超鲨充能。鲨鲨仅可被回收一次。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/e370fa57-4757-3604-3648-499e1f642d3f/abilities/ultimate/displayicon.png"}],"voiceLine":null},{"uuid":"dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6","displayName":"黑梦","description":"“黑梦”是来自小亚细亚地区的赏金猎人，她能够操纵纯粹的噩梦能量，揭开他人心底潜藏的恐惧和秘密。她会如梦魇般对敌人穷追不舍，然后在黑暗中将其摧毁殆尽。","developerName":"BountyHunter","releaseDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","characterTags":null,"displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/displayicon.png","displayIconSmall":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/displayicon.png","bustPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/fullportrait.png","fullPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/fullportrait.png","fullPortraitV2":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/fullportrait.png","killfeedPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/killfeedportrait.png","minimapPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/minimapportrait.png","homeScreenPromoTileImage":null,"background":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/background.png","backgroundGradientColors":["1d2846ff","0f1923ff","18344cff","0f192300"],"assetPath":"ShooterGame/Content/Characters/BountyHunter/BountyHunter_PrimaryAsset","isFullPortraitRightFacing":false,"isPlayableCharacter":true,"isAvailableForTest":true,"isBaseContent":false,"role":{"uuid":"1b47567f-8f7b-444b-aae3-b0c634622d10","displayName":"先锋","description":"先锋能够为队伍打开局面，帮助队友进入交战区域并驱逐敌方防守力量。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/roles/1b47567f-8f7b-444b-aae3-b0c634622d10/displayicon.png","assetPath":"ShooterGame/Content/Characters/_Core/Roles/Breaker_PrimaryDataAsset"},"recruitmentData":null,"abilities":[{"slot":"Ability1","displayName":"幽爪","description":"将恐惧之力具象化为一根套索，按【射击】将其掷出。套索会在一段时间后下落，【再次按技能键】可使它提前下落。套索会在碰触到地面后炸裂，将附近的敌人束缚在原地，并对其施加【致聋】和【腐坏】效果。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/abilities/ability1/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Ability2","displayName":"诡眼","description":"装备一颗诡眼。按【射击】将其掷出。诡眼会在一段时间后下落，【再次按技能键】可使它提前下落。诡眼会在碰触到地面后爆裂，【揭露】其视线范围内的所有敌人，并使他们留下恐惧轨迹。诡眼可被敌人摧毁。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/abilities/ability2/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Grenade","displayName":"黯兽","description":"装备一只黯兽。按【射击】使其向前扑出，【按住射击】可引导黯兽朝准星前进。黯兽将追击它所看到的第一个敌人或追踪恐惧轨迹，并在碰触到敌人时使其【视野收缩】。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/abilities/grenade/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Ultimate","displayName":"夜临","description":"引导噩梦本源的力量，按【射击】释放出排山倒海般的噩梦能量。被波及的敌人会被恐惧轨迹【标记】、并受到【致聋】和【腐坏】效果。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/dade69b4-4f5a-8528-247b-219e5a1facd6/abilities/ultimate/displayicon.png"}],"voiceLine":null},{"uuid":"5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006","displayName":"铁臂","description":"生化改造人“铁臂”来自北欧波罗的海西岸，他能够使用定向爆破和动能冲击从敌阵中强行打开一条通道。他从来不跟敌人讲道理，火力和爆破就是硬道理。","developerName":"Breach","releaseDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","characterTags":null,"displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/displayicon.png","displayIconSmall":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/displayicon.png","bustPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/fullportrait.png","fullPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/fullportrait.png","fullPortraitV2":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/fullportrait.png","killfeedPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/killfeedportrait.png","minimapPortrait":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/minimapportrait.png","homeScreenPromoTileImage":null,"background":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/background.png","backgroundGradientColors":["81331aff","0f1923ff","523a23ff","0f192300"],"assetPath":"ShooterGame/Content/Characters/Breach/Breach_PrimaryAsset","isFullPortraitRightFacing":false,"isPlayableCharacter":true,"isAvailableForTest":true,"isBaseContent":false,"role":{"uuid":"1b47567f-8f7b-444b-aae3-b0c634622d10","displayName":"先锋","description":"先锋能够为队伍打开局面，帮助队友进入交战区域并驱逐敌方防守力量。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/roles/1b47567f-8f7b-444b-aae3-b0c634622d10/displayicon.png","assetPath":"ShooterGame/Content/Characters/_Core/Roles/Breaker_PrimaryDataAsset"},"recruitmentData":null,"abilities":[{"slot":"Ability1","displayName":"闪点爆破","description":"装备【致盲】炸药。按【射击】即可在墙壁的另一侧引发一次爆破，【致盲】所有目击爆破点的玩家。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/abilities/ability1/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Ability2","displayName":"山崩地陷","description":"装备震波冲击器。【按住射击】可增加射程。【松开】便可引发震荡，使直线范围内的玩家受到【震荡】。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/abilities/ability2/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Grenade","displayName":"剧震余波","description":"装备聚变炸药。按【射击】即可透过墙壁引发一次延时生效的爆破。该冲击会对作用范围内的所有人造成严重伤害。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/abilities/grenade/displayicon.png"},{"slot":"Ultimate","displayName":"惊雷卷地","description":"装备震波炸药。按【射击】在巨大的锥形范围内发出一道穿越地形、层层递进的地震波。该地震会击飞任何受波及的玩家并震晕他们。","displayIcon":"https://media.valorant-api.com/agents/5f8d3a7f-467b-97f3-062c-13acf203c006/abilities/ultimate/displayicon.png"}],"voiceLine":null}]}